  "usefulExpressions":{"units":[
    {"unitId":"unit-1","printedPage":87,"entries":[["What's he like?","他什么样？",""],["He's tall and strong.","他又高又壮。",""],["Is he good at football?","他擅长踢足球吗？",""],["Yes, I think he is.","是的，我想他擅长。",""],["What can you do for the festival?","你能为科学艺术节做什么？",""],["I can make a robot.","我能制作机器人。",""],["Can you make robots, Sarah?","萨拉，你能制作机器人吗？",""],["No, I can't.","不，我不能。",""]]},
    {"unitId":"unit-2","printedPage":87,"entries":[["Hi, Mike. You look sad. What's the matter?","嗨，迈克。你看起来不开心。怎么回事？",""],["It's about our school project.","是关于我们学校的项目。",""],["And we have to finish our project by Monday.","并且我们得在星期一之前完成项目。",""],["So you don't agree with each other?","所以你们意见不一致？",""],["Why not do both?","为什么不两个活动都做呢？",""],["It's important to listen to each other.","听取彼此的想法很重要。",""],["Yes, Miss White. I need to talk to Mike.","是的，怀特老师。我需要和迈克谈谈。",""]]},
    {"unitId":"unit-3","printedPage":87,"entries":[["What's your favourite day at school, John?","你在学校最喜欢哪一天，约翰？",""],["What do you have on Wednesdays?","星期三你有什么课？",""],["I have Chinese, maths, music and PE.","我有语文课、数学课、音乐课和体育课。",""],["What do you usually do at the weekend, children?","孩子们，周末你们通常做什么？",""],["I often play football. Sometimes I play Chinese chess with my father.","我经常踢足球。有时我和爸爸下象棋。",""],["Does your mother work on both Saturdays and Sundays?","你妈妈周六周日都工作吗？",""],["Yes, she does.","是的，她（周末两天）都工作。",""]]},
    {"unitId":"unit-4","printedPage":87,"entries":[["How can we all stay healthy?","我们怎样才能保持健康？",""],["We should eat healthy food.","我们应该吃健康的食物。",""],["Can I play on Mum's phone?","我可以玩妈妈的手机吗？",""],["No. You shouldn't play on a phone so often.","不行。你不应总是玩手机。",""]]},
    {"unitId":"unit-5","printedPage":88,"entries":[["What would you like to eat?","你想吃些什么？",""],["I'd like beef and rice.","我想吃牛肉和米饭。",""],["Would you like some chicken soup too?","你还想喝鸡汤吗？",""],["Yes, please.","是的，请（给我鸡汤）。",""],["Where does your coconut come from?","你的椰子是哪里的？",""],["Hainan!","海南！",""]]},
    {"unitId":"unit-6","printedPage":88,"entries":[["There are also many rivers in the nature park.","这个自然公园还有许多河流。",""],["Is there a waterfall in the forest?","森林里有瀑布吗？",""],["Yes, there is.","是的，这里有。",""],["Are there any famous mountains in the nature park?","自然公园有名山吗？",""],["Yes, there are.","是的，这里有。",""],["There will be heavy rain in the afternoon too.","今天下午还将有大雨。",""]]}
  ]},
